    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Door at [-115.6, 20.98, 800.97]: BJX fork Battles.lua:22 (Npcs.json Id 46201, sh_gates_01.adr). (R) the fork's own placement, not a captured one. Region The Wilds, place The Wilds."
