    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 23 ('Mugwort's Hollow (the live dungeon: the glade's ghostly warthogs, ravens and snakes along the river, Mugwort b'): scene sg_mugworts_hollow, entry, exit, 8 waves, 31 spawns ({'Warthog Spirit': 11, 'Ghostly Raven': 10, 'Ghostly Snake': 9, 'Elder Druid Mugwort': 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1222 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sg_mugworts_hollow has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 60 coins / 220 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "The quest step and the wiki put 'Elder Mugwort' in this fight; the fork's layout had 'elder_druid_mugwort' there. (R) 'Elder Mugwort' takes those spots (wiki over the fork's roster)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier. Door actor 100000046201: reference Npcs.json Id 46201, model 111, name 5704, at [-115.6, 20.98, 800.97]."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done with the fork's last goal; the steps before it stay, as the triggers of its waves and boss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Guide overlay by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/mugwort_s_hollow.json."
